# === ALLOWLIST .gitignore ===
# This is a public repo. The local working tree contains far more than we publish:
# internal design docs (CLAUDE.md, DECISIONS.md, *-FABLE.md, *-PLAN.md ...), the
# private OTA/signing scripts, the vendored upstream engine, build output, and the
# user's own disc dump. Rather than blocklist each of those (one miss = a leak), we
# IGNORE EVERYTHING and re-include only the vetted, consumer-facing + buildable
# subset below. Anything not explicitly listed here stays LOCAL — usable for
# development, impossible to commit.

/*

# --- public: consumer-facing + reproducible source ---
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/VERSION
!/app
!/overlay
!/sidestore
!/.github
!/scripts
!/docs

# scripts/: build + overlay tooling only. The OTA/signing/dev-only scripts stay
# local (OTA is our private dev channel and must not appear on GitHub).
/scripts/publish-vision-ota.sh
/scripts/build-visionos-xcode.sh

# docs/: only the shipped screenshots. The internal build/design notes stay local.
/docs/*
!/docs/screenshots

# --- cruft (any depth) ---
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
